{"unit":121,"section":5,"cefr":"B1","objective":"understand modern Hebrew slang","skill":"Slang","heading":"Modern Hebrew slang","phrases":[{"he":"יאללה, בוא נלך כבר!","en":"Come on, let's go already!","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"יאללה","h":["come on","let's go"]},{"w":"בוא","h":["come"]},{"w":"נלך","h":["let's go"]},{"w":"כבר","h":["already"]}]},{"he":"סבבה, אין בעיה.","en":"Cool, no problem.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"סבבה","h":["cool","okay"]},{"w":"אין","h":["there isn't","no"]},{"w":"בעיה","h":["problem"]}]},{"he":"תכלס, הוא צודק.","en":"Bottom line, he's right.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"תכלס","h":["bottom line","honestly"]},{"w":"הוא","h":["he"]},{"w":"צודק","h":["right","correct"]}]},{"he":"חבל על הזמן כמה טוב!","en":"Incredibly good!","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"חבל","h":["pity","waste"]},{"w":"על","h":["on","about"]},{"w":"הזמן","h":["the time"]},{"w":"כמה","h":["how much","how"]},{"w":"טוב","h":["good"]}]},{"he":"דווקא אני חושב שזה מגניב.","en":"Actually, I think it's cool.","audio":"","tokens":[{"w":"דווקא","h":["actually","specifically"]},{"w":"אני","h":["I"]},{"w":"חושב","h":["think"]},{"w":"שזה","h":["that this is"]},{"w":"מגניב","h":["cool","awesome"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"יאללה!","en":"Come on!","alt":["Let's go!"],"t":"t"},{"he":"סבבה.","en":"Cool.","alt":["Okay."],"t":"l"},{"he":"אחלה!","en":"Great!","alt":["Awesome!"],"t":"t"},{"he":"תכלס, מה רצית?","en":"Bottom line, what did you want?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא פרייר.","en":"He's a sucker.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"זה מגניב!","en":"That's cool!","alt":["That's awesome!"],"t":"t"},{"he":"דווקא כן.","en":"Actually, yes.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"חבל על הזמן!","en":"Amazing!","alt":["Incredible!"],"t":"l"},{"he":"יאללה, בוא!","en":"Come on, let's go!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"סבבה, אני בא.","en":"Cool, I'm coming.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אחלה מקום!","en":"Great place!","alt":["Awesome place!"],"t":"l"},{"he":"תכלס, זה לא משנה.","en":"Bottom line, it doesn't matter.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אל תהיה פרייר.","en":"Don't be a sucker.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה סרט מגניב.","en":"It's a cool movie.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"דווקא היום יש שמש.","en":"Actually, today there is sun.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האוכל פה אחלה.","en":"The food here is awesome.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"יאללה ביי!","en":"See ya!","alt":["Bye!"],"t":"l"},{"he":"סבבה, נדבר מחר.","en":"Cool, we'll talk tomorrow.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"חבל על הזמן כמה יפה!","en":"Incredibly beautiful!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"תכלס, היא צודקת.","en":"Bottom line, she's right.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא לא פרייר, תאמין לי.","en":"He's not a sucker, believe me.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המסיבה הייתה מגניבה.","en":"The party was cool.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"דווקא הוא אמר את זה.","en":"Actually, he's the one who said it.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"יאללה, מספיק!","en":"Come on, enough!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"סבבה, אין בעיה בכלל.","en":"Cool, no problem at all.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אחלה אוכל במסעדה הזאת.","en":"Awesome food at this restaurant.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"תכלס, אני לא מסכים.","en":"Honestly, I don't agree.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"מי שמשלם יותר הוא פרייר.","en":"Whoever pays more is a sucker.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"השיר הזה מגניב מאוד.","en":"This song is very cool.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"דווקא היא הפתיעה אותי.","en":"Actually, she surprised me.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"חבל על הזמן הקונצרט!","en":"The concert was amazing!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"יאללה, אנחנו מאחרים!","en":"Come on, we're late!","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"סבבה, אני מסכים.","en":"Cool, I agree.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אחלה רעיון!","en":"Great idea!","alt":["Awesome idea!"],"t":"t"},{"he":"דווקא בגלל הגשם יצאנו.","en":"Actually, because of the rain we went out.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"תכלס, הוא עושה עבודה טובה.","en":"Bottom line, he does good work.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אל תהיי פראיירית.","en":"Don't be a sucker.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה דווקא מגניב שהוא בא.","en":"It's actually cool that he's coming.","alt":[],"t":"l"}],"hints":{"יאללה":"come on / let's go","סבבה":"cool / okay","אחלה":"great / awesome","תכלס":"bottom line / honestly","הוא":"he","פרייר":"sucker / pushover","זה":"this / it","מגניב":"cool / awesome","דווקא":"actually / specifically","כן":"yes","חבל":"pity / waste","על":"on / about","הזמן":"the time","בוא":"come / come on","נלך":"let's go","אני":"I","בא":"coming (m.)","מקום":"place","לא":"not / no","משנה":"matters","אל":"don't","תהיה":"be (m.)","סרט":"movie / film","היום":"today","יש":"there is","שמש":"sun","האוכל":"the food","פה":"here","ביי":"bye","נדבר":"we'll talk","מחר":"tomorrow","כמה":"how much / how","יפה":"beautiful","היא":"she","צודקת":"right / correct (f.)","תאמין":"believe (m.)","לי":"to me / me","המסיבה":"the party","הייתה":"was (f.)","מגניבה":"cool (f.)","אמר":"said","את":"(object marker)","מספיק":"enough","אין":"there isn't / no","בעיה":"problem","בכלל":"at all","אוכל":"food","במסעדה":"at the restaurant","הזאת":"this (f.)","מסכים":"agree","מי":"who","שמשלם":"who pays","יותר":"more","השיר":"the song","הזה":"this (m.)","מאוד":"very","הפתיעה":"surprised (f.)","אותי":"me","הקונצרט":"the concert","אנחנו":"we","מאחרים":"late (pl.)","רעיון":"idea","בגלל":"because of","הגשם":"the rain","יצאנו":"we went out","עושה":"does / makes","עבודה":"work / job","טובה":"good (f.)","תהיי":"be (f.)","פראיירית":"sucker (f.)","שהוא":"that he","צודק":"right / correct (m.)","כבר":"already","חושב":"think","שזה":"that this is","טוב":"good","רצית":"you wanted","מה":"what"},"words":[{"he":"אחלה","en":"great","alt":["awesome"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"akhla"},{"he":"סבבה","en":"cool","alt":["okay"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sababa"},{"he":"יאללה","en":"let's go","alt":["come on"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"yalla"},{"he":"חבל על הזמן","en":"amazing","alt":["incredible"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"khaval al hazman"},{"he":"תכלס","en":"bottom line","alt":["honestly"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"takhles"},{"he":"פרייר","en":"sucker","alt":["pushover"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"frayier"},{"he":"מגניב","en":"cool","alt":["awesome"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"magniv"},{"he":"דווקא","en":"actually","alt":["specifically","precisely"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"davka"},{"he":"מגניבה","en":"cool (f.)","alt":["awesome (f.)"],"from":"skill","tr":"magnivah"},{"he":"פראיירית","en":"sucker (f.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"frayierit"},{"he":"ביי","en":"bye","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"bai"},{"he":"מספיק","en":"enough","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"maspik"},{"he":"הפתיעה","en":"surprised","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hifti'ah"},{"he":"מאחרים","en":"late (pl.)","alt":["running late"],"from":"skill","tr":"me'akhrim"},{"he":"רעיון","en":"idea","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"ra'ayon"},{"he":"הקונצרט","en":"the concert","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hakontzert"}],"lexemes":["אחלה","סבבה","יאללה","תכלס","פרייר","פראיירית","מגניב","מגניבה","דווקא","ביי","מספיק","הפתיעה","מאחרים"],"tips":"## Modern Hebrew Slang\n\nIsraeli slang (סלנג) borrows heavily from Arabic, Yiddish, and English. These words are essential for understanding everyday conversation.\n\n### From Arabic\n| Slang | Meaning | Arabic Origin |\n|-------|---------|---------------|\n| **יאללה** | come on, let's go | يلا (yalla) |\n| **אחלה** | great, awesome | أحلى (ahla = sweetest) |\n| **סבבה** | cool, okay | صبابة (sababa) |\n\n### From Yiddish\n| Slang | Meaning | Yiddish Origin |\n|-------|---------|----------------|\n| **תכלס** | bottom line, honestly | תכלית (takhlis = purpose) |\n| **פרייר** | sucker, pushover | frayier |\n\n### From Hebrew Roots\n| Slang | Meaning | Origin |\n|-------|---------|--------|\n| **מגניב** | cool, awesome | from ג.נ.ב (to steal) -- \"steals the show\" |\n| **דווקא** | actually, precisely | classical Hebrew |\n| **חבל על הזמן** | amazing (lit. \"waste of time\") | ironic expression |\n\n### Usage Notes\n- **יאללה ביי** = casual goodbye (\"see ya!\")\n- **אל תהיה פרייר** = \"Don't be a sucker\" -- a core Israeli cultural concept\n- **דווקא** can mean \"actually\" (contrarian) or \"specifically\" depending on context\n- **חבל על הזמן** means \"so good it's unbelievable\" -- the opposite of what the words literally say!"}